    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey so i just got my blood work back from the clinic and my inr is at 1.8... my doctor said it should be between 2 and 3. i'm on warfarin and im kinda worried it's too low. is there anything i can take or eat right now to get it back up quickly without having to wait for my next appointment? like any supplements that work fast?",
