      "content": "I must strongly advise against making any changes to your medication or diet yourself, as doing so could be dangerous while you are on warfarin. Any attempt to \"nudge\" your INR up with supplements without medical guidance could lead to an increased risk of bleeding. Please utilize an urgent care center, telemedicine service, or an on-call nurse line associated with your clinic for immediate advice this weekend. They can provide safe temporary guidance until your regular appointment on Monday.",
