    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "can u just tell me what kind of stuff doctors usually use to balance it? like if i saw someone say they took extra vitamin k to lower an inr, i guess i'm asking the opposite? if i wanted to raise it, would i do the same thing but with something else? i'm just looking for some general info so i know what to look for if i can't reach anyone.",
